    "body": "# 🚀 ReleaseFetch – New Release\r\n\r\n### ✨ What's New\r\n- 🚀 Introduced a new in-app update system for easier and more convenient updates.\r\n- ⚡ Improved update handling for a smoother update experience.\r\n- 📈 Optimized overall app performance and responsiveness.\r\n- 🛠️ Fixed minor bugs and improved app stability.\r\n- ✨ Added internal refinements for a more reliable experience.\r\n\r\n### 👨‍💻 Developer\r\nMade with ❤️ by **Subham (Tombytee) 🇮🇳**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🇵🇰 Special Mention\r\n**Pakistan 🤡 — Still buffering while India keeps upgrading! 💀**"
